{"strongs": "H2932", "word": "טֻמְאָה", "translit": "tum.ah", "root": "טמא", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "uncleanness", "definition": "טֻמְאָה noun feminine uncleanness ; — absolute ׳ ט Num 5:19 + 4 t.; construct טֻמְאַת Lev 5:3 + 4 t.; suffix טֻמְאָתֵךְ Ezek 22:15 + 2 t. etc., 18 t. suffixes; plural טֻמְאֹת Lev 16:16 ; Lev 16:19 suffix טֻמְאוֺתֵיכֶם Ezek 36:25 ; Ezek 36:29 טֻמְאֹתָם Lev 16:16 — 1. sexual Num 5:19 ( P ), Lam 1:9 . 2. of a foul or filthy mass Ezek 24:11 (in a caldron), 2Chr 29:16 (in the temple). 3. ethical and religious Lev 16:16 ( P ); Ezek 22:15 ; Ezek 24:13 ; Ezek 39:24 ׳ כפר על הקדשׁ מט Lev 16:16 ( P ); ׳ קדּשׁ מט Lev 16:19 ( P ); ׳ טהר מט Ezek 24:13 ; Ezek 36:25 ׳ הושׁיע מכל ט Ezek 36:29 ׳ רוּחַ הט unclean spirit , which inspired the prophets to lie Zech 13:2 . 4. ritual, of men Lev 5:3 (twice in verse); Lev 7:20 ; Lev 7:21 ; Lev 14:19 ; Lev 15:3 (twice in verse); Lev 15:31 (twice in verse); Num 19:13 (all P ), Lev 22:3 ; Lev 22:5 ( H ); women 2Sam 11:4 וַיִּשְׁכַּב עִמָּהּ וְהִיא מִתְקַדֶּשֶׁת מִטֻמְאָתָהּ see Dr ; a time favourable to conception RS K 276 ; Lev 15:25 ; Lev 15:26 ; Lev 15:30 ( P ), Lev 18:19 ( H ), Ezek 36:17 of meats Judg 13:7 ; Judg 13:14 . 5. local, of the nations Ezra 6:21 ; Ezra 9:11 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3348')\">BDB3348</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2932')\">H2932</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3347')\">BDB3347</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3349')\">BDB3349</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>טֻמְאָה</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>uncleanness</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ט</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 5:19\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(4,5,19)\">Num 5:19</ref> + 4 t.; construct <bdbheb>טֻמְאַת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 5:3\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(3,5,3)\">Lev 5:3</ref> + 4 t.; suffix <bdbheb>טֻמְאָתֵךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 22:15\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(26,22,15)\">Ezek 22:15</ref> + 2 t. etc., 18 t. suffixes; plural <bdbheb>טֻמְאֹת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 16:16\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(3,16,16)\">Lev 16:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 16:19\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(3,16,19)\">Lev 16:19</ref> suffix <bdbheb>טֻמְאוֺתֵיכֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 36:25\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(26,36,25)\">Ezek 36:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 36:29\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(26,36,29)\">Ezek 36:29</ref> <bdbheb>טֻמְאֹתָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 16:16\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(3,16,16)\">Lev 16:16</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> sexual <ref ref=\"Num 5:19\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(4,5,19)\">Num 5:19</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Lam 1:9\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(25,1,9)\">Lam 1:9</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> of a foul or filthy mass <ref ref=\"Ezek 24:11\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(26,24,11)\">Ezek 24:11</ref> (in a caldron), <ref ref=\"2Chr 29:16\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(14,29,16)\">2Chr 29:16</ref> (in the temple). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> ethical and religious <ref ref=\"Lev 16:16\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(3,16,16)\">Lev 16:16</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); <ref ref=\"Ezek 22:15\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(26,22,15)\">Ezek 22:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 24:13\" b=\"26